2 NOTE Morian head" can refer to two things
3 CONT 1) an image of a black human head, often used as a target in historical jousting.
3 CONT In historical jousting, a "Morian head" could be a staged image, often made of cardboard, of a black face that was used as a target.
3 CONT It is important to note that the expressions "Morian head" and "Morian" themselves may be considered outdated and potentially offensive today due to their association with colonial and racist stereotypes.
