1 NOTE {geni:about_me} [https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Sparre_av_Ellinge#TAB_5 '''Elsa Nilsdotter''']. Levde troligen ännu 1505. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Var troligen''' före 1503 gift med sedermera riksrådet [https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Posse_nr_14#TAB_3 '''Axel Posse'''], vilken sedermera blev omgift med Anna Axelsdotter, dotter till riksrådet Axel Matsson ([https://w
2 CONC ww.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/H%C3%A4llekis%C3%A4tten#TAB_3 Hällekis]).
2 CONT
2 CONT /////
2 CONT
2 CONT '''In her profile''' it said she was born in Malmö. I don't know the source for that claim. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Her father was''' a hövitsman på [https://sv.wikipedia.org/wiki/%C3%84lvsborg Älvsborg] 1473-1497. And she must have been born during that time. So why Malmö?
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Sparre_av_Ellinge#TAB_5
2 CONT
2 CONT '''There was no''' place or time of death for her, but it had to be Såtenäs and around 1504-1505. 
2 CONT <br/>
2 CONT <br/>
