1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Anders Ebbesen Galt''' His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-44425590 Ebbe Mogensen Galt] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-40957812 Sophie Høegh Banner]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Anders married [https://www.geni.com/profile-31840509 Pernille Mogensdatter Gøye] circa 1525. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died in 1529. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ---- Anders Ebbesen Galt (dead 1529) was the first husband of Pernille Gøye, born 1506, died 5.3.1552.
2 CONT
2 CONT Anders Ebbesen Galt has a small mention here: http://denstoredanske.dk/Dansk_Biografisk_Leksikon/Samfund,_jura_og_politik/Myndigheder_og_politisk_styre/Rigsråd/Børge_Trolle
