2 CONC married Birgitte who seem to have come from a good family. The crest, a black timber weapon in a silver shield seems to indicate she is of the Skjalm Bangs family.
2 CONT
2 CONT Kirstine Munk was born on July 9 1598 born at Nørlund estate, he the 61 years old husband accepted the daughter as his after nine  years without a child and covered her in her birth with his family shield with the 3 roses. There i
2 CONC s very little doubt she is daughter of Otto.
2 CONT
