2 CONT
2 CONT 1606 - 1636
2 CONT
2 CONT     * BIRTH: 1606
2 CONT     * DEATH: 1636 
2 CONT
2 CONT Family 1 : SØFFRENSDATTER, Mette
2 CONT
2 CONT     * MARRIAGE: 1630
