1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Til Lydum og Hennegaard Niels Gundesen (Lange, 3 Roser) Lange''' was born circa 1430 in Lydum, Ribe, Danmark. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-31832747 Til Lydum Gunde Nielsen (Lange, 3 Roser) Lange] and [https://
2 CONC www.geni.com/profile-31832759 Bege Madsdatter Giordz]. He was a Rigsraad, Lensmand paa Aakjær, ridder 1467, ejer af Lydumgaard. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Niels married [https://www.geni.com/profile-31832737 Anne Nielsdatter Rosenkrantz] circa 1459 in Lydum, Denmark. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * 1460 [https://www.geni.com/profile-31831994 Til Lydum Thomas Nielsen Lange, til Lydum];
2 CONT * 1475 [https://www.geni.com/profile-81644698 Hans (Lange, 3 Roser) Nielsen Lange, til Lydum og Kærgaard];
2 CONT * ? [https://www.geni.com/profile-45725408 Karen Nielsdatter Lange];
2 CONT * ? [https://www.geni.com/profile-34719673096 Niels Lange, 3 Roser];
2 CONT * ? [https://www.geni.com/profile-34719673125 Claus Nielsen Lange, 3 Roser];
2 CONT * ? [https://www.geni.com/profile-34719673135 Jørgen Nielsen Lange, 3 Roser];
2 CONT * ? [https://www.geni.com/profile-34719673203 Otte Nielsen Lange, 3 Roser];
2 CONT * ? [https://www.geni.com/profile-34719673255 Til Tornumgaard Gunde Lange, 3 Roser];
2 CONT * ? [https://www.geni.com/profile-34719673337 Anne Nielsdatter Lange, 3 Roser];
2 CONT * ? [https://www.geni.com/profile-34719673590 Ide Nielsdatter Lange, 3 Roser]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on October 28, 1511 in Lydum and was buried on November 1, 1511 in Graabrødre Kirke Kloster, Ribe, Ribe Amt, Jylland, Danmark. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ---- Niels Gundesen Lange http://finnholbek.dk/genealogy/getperson.php?personID=I2189&tree=2
2 CONT
2 CONT http://skeel.info/getperson.php?personID=I5625&tree=ks
2 CONT
