2 CONT John Thomas Mann (1495 - abt. 1577)
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ===John Thomas Mann===
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Born 17 Oct 1495 in Canterbury, Kent, England
2 CONT
2 CONT Son of John Le Manns and Johanne (Thretheway) Le Manns
2 CONT
2 CONT [sibling(s) unknown]
2 CONT
2 CONT [spouse(s) unknown]
2 CONT
2 CONT Father of Agnes (Mann) Betts
2 CONT
2 CONT Died about 8 Jul 1577 at about age 81 in England
2 CONT
2 CONT Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT John Thomas Mann, 17 October 1495 – 8 July 1577 (LDS Profile G9KT-MX)
2 CONT
2 CONT Probable match for merger with (Man-117) but profile has many fact differences
2 CONT Sources
2 CONT
