2 CONT Jonas Olufssøn Bude døde 1710
2 CONT
2 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia:
2 CONT
2 CONT Jonas Budde or Jonas Olufsen Bude, (23 January 1644 – 1710) served a distinguished career in the Norwegian Army, including service at various Norwegian fortresses during the extended period of hostility between Sweden and Denmark-
2 CONC Norway. He served as an officer of Fredrikstad Fortress garrison from 1676 through 1681 (including the period of the Gyldenløve War), was the commanding officer of Christiansfjeld fortress from October 24, 1684 to February 2, 1688
2 CONC  and was lieutenant colonel (Oberstløjtnant) and commanding officer of Stavern Fortress from November 3, 1689 until his death in 1710 at sixty six years of age.
