2 CONT
2 CONT * 1st married [married 2: o with Metta Ivarsdotter, who lived in Denmark still 1525 in her 2: married married (married 1: o with the Norwegian council Anders von Bergen, died in 1491. married 3: o 1504-11-17 with the governor, the
2 CONC  knight and the council Svante Nilsson (Sture), in his 
2 CONT
2 CONT * 2nd marriage, death 1512) daughter by Ivar Jenssen (Animal), who in the gun brought two horns, and Christina Pedersdotter Oxe to Assarbo], murdered during the shelter 1502-08-18 at Akershus. 3
2 CONT
2 CONT [https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Gyllenstierna_af_Lundholm_nr_3 Gyllenstierna of Lundholm No. 3, Tab 1]
2 CONT
2 CONT (TAB 5)
2 CONT
2 CONT Knut Alfsson (son of Knut Jonsson Tab. 4 ). Knight. Swedish and Norwegian councils. 
2 CONT
2 CONT * Married 1488 with Görvel Eriksdotter, daughter of the knight, the council and the lawyer Erik Eriksson ( Gyllenstierna ) and Christina Karlsdotter ( Bonde ). 
2 CONT
2 CONT Omgift by 1499 with Mette Iversdatter, daughter of the knight Iver Jenssen ( Dyre ) and Christina Persdotter (Oxe) who later got married to the Swedish state chief Svante Nilsson ( Sture
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Children==
