2 CONT * 7 - '''Beate ROSENKRANTZ;''' Born on 15 Oct 1608 in Rosenholm, Hornslet, Randers, Denmark. Died on 20 Feb 1647 in Ringe, Svendborg, Denmark. 
2 CONT * 8 - '''Otte ROSENKRANTZ;''' Born on 24 Sep 1610 in Rosenholm, Hornslet, Randers, Denmark. Died:  	7 Jul 1639.
