2 CONC rom finding place in Brovst. There is also a cultural center in the main building.  Owners  First in the 1200s Brod Ingesen  Torsten Wild (son of Brod Ingesen)  Before 1373 Knight Ugod Torstensen (son of Torsten Wild)  1373 Niels 
